    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:b04d5d61d358e759",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "d5f617b3459acc3901595e4f97caf6e4d916ac84c54845048cf663a6c0b90334",
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer to the airport. Flight to the Galápagos. At Baltra, your guide meets you for the short bus ride and boat crossing of the Itabaca Channel to Santa Cruz, then across the island to Puerto Ayora, the landscape changing from red, rocky lowlands to the lush highlands. In the highlands, watch giant tortoises of all ages in their natural habitat on a private farm, and walk through the lava tunnels, formed by flowing lava as its surface cooled. Lunch in the highlands, then free time in Puerto Ayora. Overnight at Hotel Fiesta 4★. (B, L)",
